      "text": "word of the Lord came unto Abram, Gen. 15:1. he hath despised the word of the Lord, Num. 15:31. word of the Lord was precious in those days, 1 Sam. 3:1. Lord revealed himself to Samuel … by the word of the Lord, 1 Sam. 3:21. Good is the word of the Lord, 2 Kgs. 20:19 (Isa. 39:8). words of the Lord are pure words, Ps. 12:6. word of the Lord is right, Ps. 33:4. By the word of the Lord were the heavens made, Ps. 33:6. Hear the word of the Lord, ye rulers of Sodom, Isa. 1:10. word of the Lord from Jerusalem, Isa. 2:3 (Micah 4:2; 2 Ne. 12:3). Then came the word of the Lord to Isaiah, Isa. 38:4. Hear the word of the Lord, ye that tremble at his word, Isa. 66:5. word of the Lord came in the days of Josiah, Jer. 1:2. word of the Lord is unto them, Jer. 6:10. they have rejected the word of the Lord, Jer. 8:9. word of the Lord came to Jeremiah, Dan. 9:2. famine … of hearing the words of the Lord, Amos 8:11. run to and fro to seek the word of the Lord, Amos 8:12. word of the Lord to Israel by Malachi, Mal. 1:1.",
